CodeSystem: DevicePropertyTypeCS
Id: device-property-type-cs
Title: "Device property type"
Description: "Medical device property types from the Pharmaceutical Committee medical device registry: registry flags, shelf life and physical properties (physical_properties.property_id)"

* insert OriginalCodeSystemDraft(device-property-type-cs)

* #sterile "Sterillik"
  * ^designation[0].language = #ru
  * ^designation[=].value = "Стерильность"
  * ^designation[+].language = #en
